# Wave T39 (Perennial kit): verdiroof — Perennial's house
# roof kind, worn by the two facade houses' th cells.
# VERDIGRIS STANDING SEAM: patinated copper-green metal
# panels, a raised seam every four pixels (highlight west,
# shadow east), pale patina speckle in the faces — the
# evergreen roof of the town that never fades. Standing-seam
# metal is a different grammar from Cinder's organic moss
# mat, Highbranch's leaf scales and Canopy's glass panels.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T39-PERENNIAL-PLAN.md.)
